sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant KRBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8080/TCP TLS (platform)
    participant REST as MLServer REST<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant DP as DataPlane Handler
    participant Batcher as Adaptive Batcher
    participant Runtime as MLModel Runtime<br/>(sklearn/xgboost/onnx/...)
    participant Storage as Model Storage<br/>/mnt/models

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 1: Model Inference (REST)
    Client->>KRBAC: POST /v2/models/{name}/infer<br/>Auth: OAuth/SA Token
    KRBAC->>KRBAC: Validate token<br/>(OpenShift OAuth)
    KRBAC->>REST: Forward request<br/>(pod-local, no TLS)
    REST->>DP: Route to DataPlane
    DP->>Batcher: Queue request<br/>(if adaptive batching enabled)
    Batcher->>Runtime: Invoke predict()
    Runtime->>Storage: Load model artifacts<br/>(if not cached)
    Storage-->>Runtime: Model files
    Runtime-->>Batcher: Prediction result
    Batcher-->>DP: Batched response
    DP-->>REST: InferenceResponse
    REST-->>KRBAC: JSON response
    KRBAC-->>Client: HTTP 200 + prediction

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 2: Model Inference (gRPC)
    participant GRPCSvc as MLServer gRPC<br/>8081/TCP gRPC
    participant KRBAC2 as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8081/TCP TLS (platform)

    Client->>KRBAC2: ModelInfer RPC<br/>Auth: OAuth/SA Token
    KRBAC2->>GRPCSvc: Forward (pod-local)
    GRPCSvc->>DP: Route to DataPlane
    DP->>Runtime: Invoke predict()
    Runtime-->>DP: Prediction result
    DP-->>GRPCSvc: InferenceResponse proto
    GRPCSvc-->>KRBAC2: gRPC response
    KRBAC2-->>Client: ModelInferResponse

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 3: Metrics Scraping
    participant Prom as Prometheus
    participant MetricsSvc as MLServer Metrics<br/>8082/TCP HTTP

    Prom->>MetricsSvc: GET /metrics<br/>(no auth)
    MetricsSvc-->>Prom: Prometheus text format
